{"id":"n22426-1-7","stage":1,"title":"관광객 · 游客","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n22426-1-7-1","ko":"올해도 우리 지역 축제가 아주 성공적이군요.","zh":"今年我们地区的节日也办得非常成功呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해도","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해도","audio":"/audio/16a251b6b54a9148309b.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"지역","meaning":"地域，地区，区域","explanation":"지역：地域，地区，区域","readings":[{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71487","senseId":"1","lemma":"지역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}},{"text":"축제가","meaning":"庆典","explanation":"축제：庆典；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"축제","audio":"/audio/0bf538f6ba0e7895d423.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72136","senseId":"1","lemma":"축제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축제가","audio":"/audio/7a48f57b38268230cb25.mp3"}},{"text":"아주","meaning":"非常，极其，很","explanation":"아주：非常，极其，很","readings":[{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72484","senseId":"1","lemma":"아주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아주","audio":"/audio/dc76f888ddfaef286adb.mp3"}},{"text":"성공적이군요.","meaning":"成功的，圆满的","explanation":"성공적：成功的，圆满的；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"성공적","audio":"/audio/8d53c5fd827c7e415d99.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49060","senseId":"1","lemma":"성공적","origin":"NIKL